 "name_en": "Predictive Accounting for Sales Orders (2FD)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Predictive Accounting for Sales Orders (2FD)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio6eed7f27cb2d4a6dafd24e993632de40\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6eed7f27cb2d4a6dafd24e993632de40__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item provides a more comprehensive overview of all orders and their values for the period regardless of billing status this scope item. When a sales order is created, a revenue posting is created in extension ledger 0E.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">A report displays all incoming sales orders for a given fiscal period. The Presumed Gross Margin app displays prediction journal entries along with actuals and allows users to analyze the expected results at period/quarter end.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6eed7f27cb2d4a6dafd24e993632de40__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Review incoming sales order report</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6eed7f27cb2d4a6dafd24e993632de40__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Provides a comprehensive overview of all orders and their values for the period regardless of billing status</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>销售订单的预测会计 (2FD)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio6eed7f27cb2d4a6dafd24e993632de40\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6eed7f27cb2d4a6dafd24e993632de40__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目提供了期间内所有订单及其值的更全面概览，无论此范围项目的开票状态如何。创建销售订单时，会在扩展分类账 0E 中创建收入过账。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">报表显示给定会计期间的所有新接销售订单。“假定毛利率”应用显示预测日记账分录以及实际值，允许用户在期间/季度结束时分析预期结果。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6eed7f27cb2d4a6dafd24e993632de40__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">检查新接销售订单报表</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6eed7f27cb2d4a6dafd24e993632de40__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">提供期间内所有订单及其值的全面概览，无论开票状态如何</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
